# === MITRE ATT&CK: T1008 Fallback Channels ===
alert dns $HOME_NET any -> any 53 (msg:"MITRE T1008 Fallback C2 channel - DNS queries to dynamically generated domains"; dns.query; pcre:"/[a-z0-9]{20,}\.(click|top|xyz|tk|ml|ga|cf|gq|work|party|biz)\b/i"; classtype:trojan-activity; sid:52082069; rev:1; metadata:created_at 2026_10_01, mitre T1008;)

# === MITRE ATT&CK: T1568 Dynamic Resolution ===
